note('Author page 20 is circled; archive number 38. The inclusion diagram has seven graph objects, eight live inclusion arrows, a cancelled bidirectional mark to the right of II, and a rectangle enclosing I, II, VII and VI. The text says “Sans calcul, je peux déjà prédire” and proposes coordinates for an automorphism of VII. Its marginal “donc β\' inutile!” and “donc α\' inutile!” mark proposed eliminations; the open comparison parenthesis remains unclosed. In (70), substitution of β\'=α\'σ∞(λ) into β\'σ∞(β\')=1 yields the written second expression if σ∞ is an involution. This targeted algebraic check supports the factor order but does not decide the overwritten ρ exponent. The latter is retained as a doubtful cancelled -1. The awkward article before equations is preserved, without grammatical repair.')
